	(text "Isolators (checked on every build): AMC3330/AMC3302, TPSI3050-Q1, CNY65B, contactor and relay coil-contact. Declared HV-PE crossings: MOV3 of each varistor Y, Y capacitors, the PE-side SiC of each insulation-measurement pair, the PE-end element of the AUX dividers."
