	)
	(text "IC-17/IC-18: the whole board is conformal-coated to PD1 (IEC 60664-3 Type 1) over all HV copper and every HV-PELV isolator footprint (8-8.5 mm packages < 10 mm reinforced at PD2). Only the NH fuse links / bases and the DC terminals sit in the cooling-air path (PD3); the board,"
		(exclude_from_sim no)
		(at 20 244 0)
		(effects
			(font
				(size 1.5 1.5)
			)
			(justify left bottom)
		)
		(uuid "5b21e6de-4b07-5605-a7fe-853cf3e02314")
	)
	(text "SYS-IO-AUX: K_DISCH energised first at power-up; the port block itself inhibits the discharge of a closed port. Coil flyback never reaches the DO clamps in normal operation (two-switch coil drives, varistor / zener across each coil)."
		(exclude_from_sim no)
		(at 20 260 0)
		(effects
			(font
				(size 1.5 1.5)
			)
			(justify left bottom)
		)
		(uuid "5d476972-5a96-5933-9709-236ee499ff23")
	)
	(text "drawn here with their real MPN or an RFQ / CUSTOM specification."
