	)
	(text "Surge credit (D-032, IC-01/02/03): the on-board varistor Y limits pole-PE and pole-pole to 3.8 kV at In 3 kA (calculated) and is monitored: reinforced is dimensioned for 6 kV (AMC3302 6.25 kV, AMC3330 7.7 kV pass on this case only). IC-04 OPEN: the G7L coil-contact rating (4000 V"
