	(text "Common negative: port A and port B share BUS- (non-isolated buck-boost), so both ports are one HV domain; the main contactors switch the + pole only, fuses are in both poles. Chassis-mounted parts (terminals, fuses, CM choke, contactors, RST 200 resistors, thermostats, shunt) are"
		(exclude_from_sim no)
		(at 20 232 0)
		(effects
